They make me better.

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.863
They make me better every day.
And that's the greatest thing.

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:19.732
-I have also worked with Holly
in the past and I'm pretty sur

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:23.436
I've heard something very
