00:06:23.683 --> 00:06:26.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "What is h
talking about?"

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:29.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "The claymation
you know, in the open."

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:31.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
