00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:19.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
they're the best of the best

00:07:19.472 --> 00:07:20.907 line:92%
And our puppets do look like us.

00:07:20.907 --> 00:07:22.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think he just wants to
see our human faces.

00:07:22.942 --> 00:07:24.977
-I think that what we're finding
out is Billy Porter

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:27.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
