00:07:29.882 --> 00:07:32.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is an exclusive
to your show.

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:34.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is -- I'm glad that we go
to the bottom of this.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You weren't just a travelin
